{"4016120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Luna Anomaly", "steam_appid": 4016120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A town frozen in time. A spirit that won’t let go. Can you trust what you see?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luna Anomaly</strong> is a psychological horror game set in 1950s Italy. You play as Luna, a young woman trapped in a remote coastal town haunted by a restless spirit. The streets and houses may feel familiar, but reality twists with each cycle. To escape its grasp, you must stay alert—spotting anomalies that distort the world around you and exposing signs of the haunting before it consumes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016120/extras/360a0a0495f78a7873d7baacdf810339.poster.avif?t=1779482352\" width=660 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016120/extras/360a0a0495f78a7873d7baacdf810339.webm?t=1779482352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016120/extras/360a0a0495f78a7873d7baacdf810339.mp4?t=1779482352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town is alive with signs of the spirit’s presence. Objects shift, shadows linger, and whispers echo through empty streets. With over 40 anomalies ranging from subtle environmental changes to disturbing sights, danger hides in every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the street you must make a critical choice that will determine your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survival hinges on your memory, focus, and nerve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016120/extras/2050d5df44b64134e1258824390611fc.poster.avif?t=1779482352\" width=660 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016120/extras/2050d5df44b64134e1258824390611fc.webm?t=1779482352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016120/extras/2050d5df44b64134e1258824390611fc.mp4?t=1779482352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 anomalies to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror rooted in observation, memory, and dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized runs ensure every playthrough feels unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An oppressive, immersive atmosphere where every detail matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016120/extras/19911838e20040391b65158720ff068e.poster.avif?t=1779482352\" width=660 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016120/extras/19911838e20040391b65158720ff068e.webm?t=1779482352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016120/extras/19911838e20040391b65158720ff068e.mp4?t=1779482352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town whispers. The spirit waits. Will you find your way out, or vanish like the rest...</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A town frozen in time. A spirit that won’t let go. Can you trust what you see?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luna Anomaly</strong> is a psychological horror game set in 1950s Italy. Y